Cell["\<\
The path the current can follow now bypasses the battery, but still goes \
through the resistor. Because of the resistor, the current cannot discharge \
all at once.

Symbolically, what is the current initially through the resistor? Remember, \
before the switch was thrown (I hope you discovered in the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Charging the Capacitor\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
section), the capacitor had been charged up to the voltage that the battery \
puts out, and the current had stopped flowing.

Qualitatively, what happens to the voltage on the capacitor and the current \
through the resistor after a little time has passed, and some current has \
flowed to partially discharge the capacitor?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978768919926632*^9, 3.978769149469356*^9}, {
  3.978769240461761*^9, 3.9787692410074577`*^9}, {3.9787692884346743`*^9, 
  3.978769426305768*^9}, {3.978769496557528*^9, 3.9787695462685423`*^9}, {
  3.978769850874934*^9, 3.9787702444135447`*^9}, {3.9787702881720037`*^9, 
  3.9787705093896523`*^9}, {3.978770545542075*^9, 3.978770595743319*^9}, {
  3.9787706722513027`*^9, 3.978770858661024*^9}, {3.9787711378273153`*^9, 
  3.978771265452713*^9}, {3.978771482978774*^9, 3.978771542952291*^9}, {
  3.9787715793273783`*^9, 3.978771586615888*^9}, {3.979371332035356*^9, 
  3.9793714738960133`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"09838d8a-ebb1-4d2d-a90e-\
c288e4c2050b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The RC Time Constant", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGCQAGIQvejASQaRRW8dr7++wQiiHwcpzpgGpKUMf80E0eFt
PNkzgPQjf8EcEH1shsxZED2nhe8ciD5amO05E0grZDN5g+iFE4/n+S9+65hm
fw9MJ3YdFA4E0nzMt8E0U/Hy5ZlAuuTROjAtd+XYahA9q7ZnA4hecn/9FhD9
QekrmM7g3P4BRN9LufwdRAeI3wnPBtJWcs/BtF0c14VNQLrs/TMwrZF88wqI
Xi7MfxVEX3PpY3i65K2jztdERhC9x+qgMYjO0VhqAqLFZWpVngHpL5Ui6iC6
jGGDHYi+UyZuD6IFykO2gulTB8H0wZSlEs+B9FlmFUkQPeu7jRaIviw8RRtE
p3jmmoDoU0mzwLT4BP5MEF2gWA2mGUx/LALRe3RWLwbRAHtY0Y8=
  "],ExpressionUUID->"2ccf0911-670a-418e-afec-cc4d9fe82815"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["R", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "26d8890e-eda6-4aa6-a293-ab98047e105e"],
 " are Ohms and the units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["C", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6ed40d93-541c-4e2b-8ae9-ce9bc260eb83"],
 " are Farads. Interestingly, the units of RC are just seconds!\n\nAs an \
example, and for definiteness, consider a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"10", "\[Mu]F"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "58307bcc-c004-45e0-9b98-72f64dabec39"],
 " capacitor and a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"47", "k\[CapitalOmega]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c120ffe2-2126-4415-865c-1ad108319a48"],
 " resistor charged up by a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"6", 
    StyleBox["V",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8cc25c31-7fb6-4cd1-96f5-5efd47860c8e"],
 " battery. That means that when fully charged by the battery, the capacitor \
had a voltage of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"6", "V"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4bff0d58-1f59-4ed4-a261-ee981e1dd2ea"],
 " and a charge of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"60", "\[Mu]C"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e58bc623-8cf6-4a00-9a63-173a76a0e24f"],
 ".\n\nWhat is RC? Answer: it is 470 milliseconds, or about 0.5 seconds."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978768919926632*^9, 3.978769149469356*^9}, {
  3.978769240461761*^9, 3.9787692410074577`*^9}, {3.9787692884346743`*^9, 
  3.978769426305768*^9}, {3.978769496557528*^9, 3.9787695462685423`*^9}, {
  3.978769850874934*^9, 3.9787702444135447`*^9}, {3.9787702881720037`*^9, 
  3.9787705093896523`*^9}, {3.978770545542075*^9, 3.978770595743319*^9}, {
  3.9787706722513027`*^9, 3.978770858661024*^9}, {3.9787711378273153`*^9, 
  3.978771265452713*^9}, {3.978771482978774*^9, 3.978771542952291*^9}, {
  3.9787715793273783`*^9, 3.978771586615888*^9}, {3.9787717496775627`*^9, 
  3.978771845511312*^9}, {3.978772051499498*^9, 3.978772067155554*^9}, {
  3.9787730511828337`*^9, 3.978773051182947*^9}, {3.97877317588468*^9, 
  3.978773175884797*^9}, {3.979371483905298*^9, 3.979371528090603*^9}, {
  3.9793737955463753`*^9, 
  3.979373795937249*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5e3a70c7-4dbf-43d6-b170-\
c6fc86beb407"]
}, Open  ]],

