Cell["\<\
We are going to fill in the first few rows of this table on the board rather \
than having Mathematica do all the work for us.

Everything that is going to happen in the rows of the table starts from the \
fact that the capacitor has been charged to 6V and holds 60\[Mu]C of change \
when the SPDT switch was thrown to bypass the battery.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978768919926632*^9, 3.978769149469356*^9}, {
