Cell["\<\
It is pretty easy to exactly put what the answer is for every entry in the \
table because this problem can be exactly solved with calculus.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978768919926632*^9, 3.978769149469356*^9}, {
  3.978769240461761*^9, 3.9787692410074577`*^9}, {3.9787692884346743`*^9, 
